    OR  elem (i's `kind`) `the property named in exclusion 8(d) and (e)`
    OR  `a direct cause of the Damage to` i `is one of` (LIST `a drying process or a process using heat`)
    OR  (    i's `circumstances`'s `being installed or moved`
         AND `a direct cause of the Damage to` i `is one of` (LIST `installing or moving the machinery or equipment, including dismantling and re-erecting it`))
    OR  i's `circumstances`'s `insured in some other way`

