GIVETH A LIST OF `A cause`
`the perils written back by exclusion 11, Part 1` MEANS
    LIST fire
       , lightning
       , explosion
       , `falling aircraft`
       , `impact by vehicles`
       , `falling objects`
       , windstorm
       , hail
       , whirlwind
       , riot
       , strike
       , `civil commotion`
       , hooliganism
       , `acts of sabotage`
       , earthquake
       , `volcanic eruption`
       , tsunami
       , freezing
       , `the weight of ice and snow`

@ref exclusion 11, Part 1 (src:215-237)
GIVEN i IS A `A damaged item`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`exclusion 11, Part 1, excludes the Damage to` i MEANS
        `any cause of the Damage to` i `is one of` `the causes named in exclusion 11, Part 1`
    AND NOT (    i's `circumstances`'s `at the insured premises`
             AND `a direct cause of the Damage to` i `is one of` `the perils written back by exclusion 11, Part 1`)

