§ `A cause not excluded`

-- "một nguyên nhân không bị hợp đồng bảo hiểm này loại trừ": the write-backs of exclusions 1(a),
-- 1(b), 1(c), 5 and 8(h) turn on whether a cause is excluded. A cause is excluded for an item
-- where an exclusion that names causes names it, with that exclusion's own condition. Fork F10:
-- the exclusions that name kinds of property (6, 7, 8(a)-(e), (i), 9) do not make a cause an
-- excluded cause.
@ref exclusions 1-5, 8(f)-(h), 10, 11 (src:29-248)
GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
      i IS A `A damaged item`
      c IS A `A cause`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the cause is excluded for the item` l i c MEANS
        elem c `the causes named in exclusion 1(a)`
    OR  elem c `the causes named in exclusion 1(b)`
    OR  `the cause falls under exclusion 1(c)` l c
    OR  `the cause falls under exclusion 1(d)` i c
    OR  elem c `the causes named in exclusion 2`
    OR  `the cause falls under exclusion 3` l c
    OR  elem c `the causes named in exclusion 4`
    OR  c EQUALS `pollution or contamination`
    OR  c EQUALS `a drying process or a process using heat`
    OR  (    c EQUALS `installing or moving the machinery or equipment, including dismantling and re-erecting it`
         AND i's `circumstances`'s `being installed or moved`)
    OR  (    c EQUALS `the repair, inspection, installation or maintenance work`
         AND i's `circumstances`'s `undergoing repair, inspection, installation or maintenance`)
    OR  (    c EQUALS `explosion or rupture of the boiler, vessel, machine or apparatus itself`
         AND elem (i's `kind`) `the property named in the first exclusion 10`)
    OR  elem c `the causes named in the second exclusion 10(a)(i)`
    OR  elem c `the causes named in exclusion 11, Part 1`

GIVEN i IS A `A damaged item`
      l IS A `A loss`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`a cause not excluded directly caused the Damage to` i `in` l MEANS
    any (GIVEN k YIELD NOT (`the cause is excluded for the item` l i (k's `the cause`))) (`the direct links of` i)

-- The link itself followed from earlier Damage by a cause not excluded.
GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
      i IS A `A damaged item`
      k IS A `A link in the chain of causation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the link followed from earlier Damage by a cause not excluded` l i k MEANS
    CONSIDER k's `resulting from earlier Damage by`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST c  THEN NOT (`the cause is excluded for the item` l i c)

§ `What each exclusion does to an item`

GIVETH A `The effect of the exclusions on an item`
`no exclusion` MEANS `no exclusion applies`

GIVEN `the clause` IS A STRING
GIVETH A `The effect of the exclusions on an item`
`excluded by clause` `the clause` MEANS `excluded by` (LIST `the clause`)

GIVEN `the clause` IS A STRING
GIVETH A `The effect of the exclusions on an item`
`apportioned by clause` `the clause` MEANS
    `excluded except for the part arising from a cause not excluded` (LIST `the clause`)

-- 1(a): "trừ khi Tổn hại được gây ra bởi một nguyên nhân không bị hợp đồng bảo hiểm này loại
-- trừ, khi đó Bảo Minh sẽ chỉ có trách nhiệm bồi thường đối với phần Tổn hại phát sinh từ các
-- nguyên nhân đó".
@ref exclusion 1(a) (src:30-36)
GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
      i IS A `A damaged item`
GIVETH A `The effect of the exclusions on an item`
`exclusion 1(a) on` l i MEANS
    BRANCH IF NOT `a direct cause of the Damage to` i `is one of` `the causes named in exclusion 1(a)`
           THEN `no exclusion`
           IF `a cause not excluded directly caused the Damage to` i `in` l
           THEN `apportioned by clause` "exclusion 1(a)"
           OTHERWISE `excluded by clause` "exclusion 1(a)"

-- 1(b): "trừ khi các tổn thất này được gây một cách trực tiếp do việc có Tổn hại xảy ra cho tài
-- sản được bảo hiểm hoặc cho ngôi nhà chứa các tài sản đó bởi một nguyên nhân không bị hợp đồng
-- bảo hiểm này loại trừ". A 1(b) link that followed from Damage by a cause not excluded is
-- written back; any other direct 1(b) link excludes the Damage.
@ref exclusion 1(b) (src:37-43)
GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
      i IS A `A damaged item`
GIVETH A `The effect of the exclusions on an item`
`exclusion 1(b) on` l i MEANS
    IF   any (GIVEN k YIELD     elem (k's `the cause`) `the causes named in exclusion 1(b)`
                            AND NOT (`the link followed from earlier Damage by a cause not excluded` l i k))
             (`the direct links of` i)
    THEN `excluded by clause` "exclusion 1(b)"
    ELSE `no exclusion`

-- 1(c): "trừ khi (i) ... và (ii) ...". Fork F5: the two limbs are joined by "và" (and), so both
-- must hold: (i) a cause not excluded directly caused the Damage, and (ii) every 1(c) link
-- followed from Damage by a cause not excluded. Then only the part from that cause is covered.
@ref exclusion 1(c) (src:48-63)
GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
      i IS A `A damaged item`
GIVETH A `The effect of the exclusions on an item`
`exclusion 1(c) on` l i MEANS
    LET `the 1(c) links` MEANS filter (GIVEN k YIELD `the cause falls under exclusion 1(c)` l (k's `the cause`))
                                      (`the direct links of` i)
    IN  BRANCH IF null `the 1(c) links`
               THEN `no exclusion`
               IF     `a cause not excluded directly caused the Damage to` i `in` l
                  AND all (GIVEN k YIELD `the link followed from earlier Damage by a cause not excluded` l i k) `the 1(c) links`
               THEN `apportioned by clause` "exclusion 1(c)"
               OTHERWISE `excluded by clause` "exclusion 1(c)"

@ref exclusion 1(d) (src:64-70)
GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
      i IS A `A damaged item`
GIVETH A `The effect of the exclusions on an item`
`exclusion 1(d) on` l i MEANS
    IF   any (GIVEN k YIELD `the cause falls under exclusion 1(d)` i (k's `the cause`)) (`the direct links of` i)
    THEN `excluded by clause` "exclusion 1(d)"
    ELSE `no exclusion`

@ref exclusion 2 (src:71-75)
GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
      i IS A `A damaged item`
GIVETH A `The effect of the exclusions on an item`
`exclusion 2 on` l i MEANS
    IF   `any cause of the Damage to` i `is one of` `the causes named in exclusion 2`
    THEN `excluded by clause` "exclusion 2"
    ELSE `no exclusion`

@ref exclusion 3 (src:76-104)
GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
      i IS A `A damaged item`
GIVETH A `The effect of the exclusions on an item`
`exclusion 3 on` l i MEANS
    IF   any (GIVEN k YIELD     `the cause falls under exclusion 3` l (k's `the cause`)
                            AND NOT (`the proviso to exclusion 3 d) keeps the Damage covered` l (k's `the cause`)))
             (i's `the chain of causation`)
    THEN `excluded by clause` "exclusion 3"
    ELSE `no exclusion`

@ref exclusion 4 (src:111-119)
GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
      i IS A `A damaged item`
GIVETH A `The effect of the exclusions on an item`
`exclusion 4 on` l i MEANS
    IF   `any cause of the Damage to` i `is one of` `the causes named in exclusion 4`
    THEN `excluded by clause` "exclusion 4"
    ELSE `no exclusion`

@ref exclusion 5 (src:120-125)
GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
      i IS A `A damaged item`
GIVETH A `The effect of the exclusions on an item`
`exclusion 5 on` l i MEANS
    BRANCH IF NOT `any cause of the Damage to` i `is one of` (LIST `pollution or contamination`)
           THEN `no exclusion`
           IF `exclusion 5(a) writes the Damage back` l i
           THEN `no exclusion`
           IF `exclusion 5(b) writes the Damage back` l i
           THEN `no exclusion`
           OTHERWISE `excluded by clause` "exclusion 5"

GIVEN `the clause` IS A STRING
      `it excludes` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The effect of the exclusions on an item`
`the effect of` `the clause` `where` `it excludes` MEANS
    IF `it excludes` THEN `excluded by clause` `the clause` ELSE `no exclusion`

-- 8(h), apportioned like 1(a).
@ref exclusion 8(h) (src:164-167)
GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
      i IS A `A damaged item`
GIVETH A `The effect of the exclusions on an item`
`exclusion 8(h) on` l i MEANS
    BRANCH IF NOT `exclusion 8(h) reaches the Damage to` i
           THEN `no exclusion`
           IF `a cause not excluded directly caused the Damage to` i `in` l
           THEN `apportioned by clause` "exclusion 8(h)"
           OTHERWISE `excluded by clause` "exclusion 8(h)"

§ `All the exclusions, in the document's order`

-- The first exclusion that takes the Damage out wholly decides; failing one, every exclusion
-- that apportions is listed; failing those, no exclusion applies. Evaluated in the document's
-- order, so a fact that a later exclusion needs is not asked for when an earlier one already
-- excludes.
GIVEN effects IS A LIST OF `The effect of the exclusions on an item`
GIVETH A `The effect of the exclusions on an item`
`the combined effect of` effects MEANS
    CONSIDER effects
    WHEN EMPTY THEN `no exclusion applies`
    WHEN e FOLLOWED BY rest THEN
        CONSIDER e
        WHEN `excluded by` cl THEN e
        WHEN `no exclusion applies` THEN `the combined effect of` rest
        WHEN `excluded except for the part arising from a cause not excluded` cl THEN
            CONSIDER `the combined effect of` rest
            WHEN `excluded by` cl2 THEN `excluded by` cl2
            WHEN `no exclusion applies` THEN e
            WHEN `excluded except for the part arising from a cause not excluded` cl2
                THEN `excluded except for the part arising from a cause not excluded` (append cl cl2)

@ref exclusions 1-11 (src:27-248)
GIVEN l IS A `A loss`
      i IS A `A damaged item`
GIVETH A `The effect of the exclusions on an item`
`the effect of the exclusions on` l i MEANS
    `the combined effect of`
        (LIST `exclusion 1(a) on` l i
            , `exclusion 1(b) on` l i
            , `exclusion 1(c) on` l i
            , `exclusion 1(d) on` l i
            , `exclusion 2 on` l i
            , `exclusion 3 on` l i
            , `exclusion 4 on` l i
            , `exclusion 5 on` l i
            , `the effect of` "exclusion 6"  `where` (`exclusion 6 excludes the Damage to` i)
            , `the effect of` "exclusion 7"  `where` (`exclusion 7 excludes the Damage to` i)
            , `the effect of` "exclusion 8"  `where` (`exclusion 8 excludes the Damage to` i)
            , `exclusion 8(h) on` l i
            , `the effect of` "exclusion 10 (pressure vessels)" `where` (`the first exclusion 10 excludes the Damage to` i)
            , `the effect of` "exclusion 10 (electronic data)"  `where` (`the second exclusion 10 excludes the Damage to` i)
            , `the effect of` "exclusion 11, Part 1" `where` (`exclusion 11, Part 1, excludes the Damage to` i)
            , `the effect of` "exclusion 11, Part 2" `where` (`exclusion 11, Part 2, excludes the amount claimed for` i))
